{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14237","headline":"凉国惠康公主挽歌 · 窦常","name":"凉国惠康公主挽歌","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉立分尧绪，笄年下相门。\n早加于氏对，偏占馆陶恩。\n泪有潜成血，香无却返魂。\n共知何驸马，垂白抱天孙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦常","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14237.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14237","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}